00:03:18.331 --> 00:03:21.935 size:88% position:44% line:92%
is like, "Who hurt you?"

00:03:23.636 --> 00:03:26.272 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I, uh...

00:03:26.272 --> 00:03:28.241 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was recently on this --
on this airplane.

00:03:28.241 --> 00:03:31.211 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was a very small airplane
that had been remodeled

00:03:31.211 --> 00:03:33.446 align:start size:94% position:6%
