00:03:41.354 --> 00:03:42.388 line:92%
It just looked into the hallway.

00:03:42.388 --> 00:03:44.624 align:start size:94% position:6%
So then when
the flight attendant came over

00:03:44.624 --> 00:03:48.661 size:75% position:38%
