00:03:48.661 --> 00:03:52.632 align:start size:94% position:6%
the curtain fell
right in front of my face.

00:03:52.632 --> 00:03:57.470 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, I was a secret
for first class.

00:03:57.470 --> 00:03:59.072 size:84% position:42% line:92%
