all over again."

00:04:16.522 --> 00:04:20.727 line:92%
And she says "No, we have to."

00:04:20.727 --> 00:04:21.294 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I'm like, "Okay.

00:04:21.294 --> 00:04:24.030
But, once again, I'm just gonn
make the slightest movement,

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:26.699 align:start size:94% position:6%
and the curtain's gonna fall
all over again.

00:04:26.699 --> 00:04:28.301 line:92%
Can you just not put it up?"

00:04:28.301 --> 00:04:31.838 line:92%
And she goes, "No, we have to.

00:04:31.838 --> 00:04:35.642 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And then I asked...

00:04:35.642 --> 00:04:37.877 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
